    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_dea1149e",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image features Oprah Winfrey with a visibly frustrated or annoyed facial expression, paired with the text 'when someone is talkin to you and you gotta shit.' The overall intent is to humorously depict the universal, relatable experience of being interrupted or having to urgently attend to a bodily need while engaged in a conversation. The meme relies on the juxtaposition of Oprah’s expressive face — often associated with her empathetic and communicative persona — with the mundane, awkward situation described in the text. There is no toxicity present in this meme. It does not target any protected group, nor does it contain abusive, hateful, misogynistic, or harmful content. The intent is purely comedic and self-deprecating, using a well-known public figure’s expressive face to amplify the relatability of a common human experience. The meme is not propagandistic and does not aim to influence opinions or actions toward a specific goal beyond eliciting laughter or recognition.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_42f06420"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
