      "label": "Person experiencing urgent bodily need while being spoken to",
      "description": "The scene depicts Oprah Winfrey with a visibly frustrated or annoyed facial expression, suggesting she is caught in an awkward situation where she must urgently attend to a bodily need while someone is talking to her. The text overlay reinforces this interpretation. The scene is composed of the person and the text, with the person's expression and the text working together to convey the humorous, relatable scenario.",
