      "instance_name": "urgent_bodily_need",
      "label": "Urgent Bodily Need",
      "description": "The concept of an urgent bodily need (e.g., needing to use the restroom) is a universal human experience. The meme humorously depicts the awkwardness and frustration of being interrupted or unable to leave a conversation due to such a need. This concept is not visually depicted but is essential to understanding the text's meaning.",
