      "instance_name": "relatable_meme_culture",
      "label": "Relatable Meme Culture",
      "description": "The meme relies on the cultural phenomenon of 'relatable' humor — where people share experiences that others can easily identify with. This concept is not visible in the image but is necessary to understand why the meme is effective and widely shared. It involves the shared understanding of social awkwardness and the universal nature of bodily functions.",
